 "words_heard": 242,
 "words": 244,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Before a single star was hung, before the hills were made",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God spoke a word into the dark and all the worlds obeyed",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The things we see were fashioned out of what no eye had seen",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By faith we understand it, and on that word we lean",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the assurance of what we hope for",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The conviction of what we do not see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the assurance of what we hope for",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The conviction of what we do not see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It was by faith that the people of old received God's approval",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Abel brought a better gift and God called him righteous",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Though he is dead, his faith still speaks across the years to us",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Enoch walked to please the Lord and never did see death",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God took him up and he was not found, gone like a morning breath",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the assurance of what we hope for",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The conviction of what we do not see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith is the assurance of what we hope for",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The conviction of what we do not see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Without faith it is impossible to please him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever comes to God must believe that he exists",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
